ready seen all possible feature values.\nSo not including smoothing shouldn't really make such a big difference. \n\nIt seems the BernoulliNB class from sklearn also has this problem.\n\nMy inefficient but straightforward implementation performs expectedly well on the training set.\nCode to reproduce the issue with some more tests is available at http://pastebin.com/2hsrA8xL\nI hope the issue is not caused by some trivial implementation detail I've overlooked.\n","closed_by":{"login":"jmschrei","id":3916816,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM5MTY4MTY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3916816?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jmschrei","html_url":"https://github.com/jmschrei","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jmschrei/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jmschrei/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jmschrei/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jmschrei/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jmschrei/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jmschrei/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jmschrei/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jmschrei/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jmschrei/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scikit-learn/scikit-learn/issues/5814/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scikit-learn/scikit-learn/issues/5814/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}